sequenceDiagram
    participant Staff
    participant API as Petshop_API
    participant MediatR
    participant Hub as SignalR_Hub
    participant Channel as ITutorNotificationChannel

    Staff->>API: POST grooming-appointments/id/ready
    API->>API: MarkReady SaveChanges
    API->>MediatR: DomainEventEnvelope
    MediatR->>MediatR: GroomingStatusChangedEvent
    MediatR->>Hub: tenant group broadcast
    alt IsEnabled
        MediatR->>Channel: NotifyGroomingStatusAsync
    end
